/target
**/*.rs.bk
Cargo.lock.orig

# The capture corpus is committed, under `captures/`. Recordings anywhere else
# in the tree are someone's working files, not part of it. The first rule is
# not redundant: a global ignore of `captures/` excludes the directory outright,
# and git does not look inside an excluded directory for the re-inclusions below.
!captures/
*.pcap
*.pcapng
!captures/**
